 false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 163, "created": 1792633721000, "id": "2113085098824548483", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113084968595333120/img/deg0qh72PMmGFxXg.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113084968595333120/pl/d5H1-IEcIm9Q9X-_.m3u8?v=6f4", "aspectRatio": [9, 16], "heightRatio": 177, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113084968595333120/vid/avc1/320x568/lM7FxpwYNvaT0gSc.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1653093448822542336/eMRq3ayO_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Jeffery Mead", "username": "the_jefferymead"}, "content": "El Sayed seems to think everybody is too stupid to notice him contradict himself. \n\nThe levels of hubris are wild\ud83d\ude02", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 5214}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVjihzDJ", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 22, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8899195, "raw_content": "The city council recently voted to cover the existing Flock cameras, and let our current contract lapse. Big win!\n\nCovering is important: apparently, Flock isn't _removing_ cameras from towns that cancel or don't renew; they've been leaving the cameras up, and just removing the locality's access. Meaning, the town now no longer controls who has access.\n\nKeep fighting against these! More and more city council votes, resolutions, and referendums are coming up across the country. Get one going in your town, and have these things removed!", "author": "Floridacus", "created": 1792640839749, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Moebius", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Hometown's Banning Flock", "last_comment_created": 1792645628322, "content": "<p>The city council recently voted to cover the existing Flock cameras, and let our current contract lapse. Big win!</p>\n<p>Covering is important: apparently, Flock isn't <em>removing</em> cameras from towns that cancel or don't renew; they've been leaving the cameras up, and just removing the locality's access. Meaning, the town now no longer controls who has access.</p>\n<p>Keep fighting against these! More and more city council votes, resolutions, and referendums are coming up across the country. Get one going in your town, and have these things removed!</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 22, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2113136363545743466", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVjiiX70", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 11, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8899366, "raw_content": "", "author": "kinbergfan", "created": 1792654419493, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "kinbergfan", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVjiiX70.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/isengrimm3/status/2113136363545743466", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Not one country bought lasting peace with ANY AGGRESSOR by giving it land.   The dumb people demanding Ukrain